WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.808 --> 00:00:02.537
(orchestral music)

00:00:02.537 --> 00:00:04.026
- All right gentlemen.

00:00:04.026 --> 00:00:05.026
Crank it up!

00:00:05.878 --> 00:00:08.795
(orchestral music)

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.770
I was naive enough to believe
that I could do something

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.260
that people said couldn't be done.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.950
But if you really want
to do somethin' new,

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.940
you've gotta go where it's scary.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.700
Lyle Small, I'm the president
of Chromatic Technologies.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.290
We make the ink that makes
the mountains turn blue

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.962
when it's cold on the Coors Light can.

00:00:31.962 --> 00:00:36.962
(inspirational music)
(ice crackling)

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:50.083
I'm just a nerd that makes
goo that changes colors.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.720
To make it great I need
somebody like Kiri Leigh.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:55.553
- Hi.
- Hi.

00:00:55.553 --> 00:00:57.410
- I'm Kiri.
- Hi Kiri, I'm Lyle.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.243
- [Kiri] Nice to meet you.

00:00:58.243 --> 00:00:59.076
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:59.076 --> 00:01:00.240
Welcome to CTI.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.860
Kiri Leigh Jones and I
have partnered together

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:05.990
to bring her artistic talent,

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:09.790
and CTI's color change
cold technology together

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.920
and create a unique piece of art.

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:15.410
And I'm so excited to see
what'll happen with it.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:17.300
- I paint mostly murals.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:20.280
So I've just always believed
that everything is a canvas.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.820
I love to experiment.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:23.770
I just always wanna be learning.

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:27.090
So kind of what I'm envisioning
for this big art project

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.320
is the concept of a kaleidoscope.

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:32.190
The kaleidoscope's gonna
go in and out of the colors

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.740
like you're looking through a snowflake

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.118
and these are all the colors that

00:01:35.118 --> 00:01:35.951
are coming out.
- Oh, fantastic.

00:01:35.951 --> 00:01:37.630
So it'll be complicated,

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:41.480
but create an invisible piece
of art that comes to life

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:42.960
when you make it cold.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:46.010
So the idea would be, we
have this platform here

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:48.023
that has a chilled background to it.

00:01:48.023 --> 00:01:49.317
- I've never seen anything like this.

00:01:49.317 --> 00:01:51.380
- No, no.
- Never heard of anything

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.213
like this.
- No.

00:01:52.213 --> 00:01:53.800
Who would be crazy enough to do it, right?

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:54.633
- Us.

00:01:54.633 --> 00:01:57.024
- Yes, that's right.
(Kiri laughing)

00:01:57.024 --> 00:02:00.191
(inspirational music)

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:09.140
- I am painting a giant refrigerated,

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:11.400
aluminum canvas

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.750
with the color-changing paint

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:15.770
that cools down to be in color,

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:17.760
and then when it's at room
temperature, it's white.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:20.100
So it basically looks like it's invisible.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:21.790
He kept saying it was
invisible (chuckling).

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:24.720
And I kept thinking
there's no possible way.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:25.553
But, yeah, no.

00:02:25.553 --> 00:02:26.733
It's definitely invisible.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:31.177
It looks kind of pink and
then it goes away immediately.

00:02:31.177 --> 00:02:32.990
(playful music)

00:02:32.990 --> 00:02:35.020
After hearing Lyle talk about it

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:37.210
and being so specific about the degrees

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:38.560
that it was gonna change,

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.232
I was

00:02:40.232 --> 00:02:41.959
very confused.

00:02:41.959 --> 00:02:43.559
(chuckling) I was very confused.

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.790
My biggest qualm is mixing the colors

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:49.333
and not being able to see it.

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:54.373
So I'm interested to see
if all the colors stayed.

00:02:54.373 --> 00:02:57.540
(playful music)

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:58.940
I will know in nine degrees.

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:07.860
All the colors are showing up.

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:09.953
It reacts with the cold pretty quickly.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.490
So it's very easy now (chuckles)

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.540
to see where I'm painting, which is cool.

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.540
Hi.
- Hey.

00:03:18.540 --> 00:03:20.400
- How are you?
- Oh, I'm great.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.240
That is beautiful.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.880
- So it's supposed to
look like a kaleidoscope.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.900
So when it starts to cool down,

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:28.330
you'll start to see
all the changing colors

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:30.080
and all of the things come to life.

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.510
- How nice.

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:33.553
All right, so let's check this out here.

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:35.543
Oh, wow.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.220
It's crazy, it's like
I'm discovering the piece

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.493
as I'm spraying it.
- Yes.

00:03:41.493 --> 00:03:44.407
- I mean, I had no idea
all this stuff was in here.

00:03:44.407 --> 00:03:46.180
- [Kiri] And I'm discovering that I forgot

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.431
to put green paint right there.

00:03:47.431 --> 00:03:50.200
(both laughing)

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.960
I want everyone to be
standing in front of it

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.830
and literally feel that exhale of coldness

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.110
as it rushes over them.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:04:00.490
- I hope that when they see it,

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:03.847
they get the sense that
something magical has happened.

00:04:03.847 --> 00:04:07.014
(inspirational music)

